                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Drill-down: a click on a pyramid band, a donut segment or a layer option filters the page in place and writes the filter to the URL (second frame, /?layer=unit). Drill-through: a workspace name opens its page. The classic shape: many unit tests at the base, integration (component) in the middle, end-to-end (acceptance) at the top. Each band fills with the share of its subjects that are measured. Sample data: main at 0514dc9, 20 Nov 2026.",
